A table row or a definition under a paragraph ends it before an unclosed fence

````
::: note
para
| t |
```
code
::::
:::
after *b*
.
<aside class="admonition note" aria-label="Note">
  <p>para</p>
  <table>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>t</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <pre><code>code
::::
</code></pre>
</aside>
<p>after <strong>b</strong></p>
````

